     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project inception was conducted in August 2021. Consequently, the period August to De-cember 2021 was used to implement preparatory activities and restoration work was re-scheduled to 2022.

Output 1: Degraded wetlands, and associated catchments restored and or rehabilitated and intact wetlands protected
This output was not accomplished. It was affected by demarcation that was not done. The restoration process starts with demarcation of wetland boundaries. Catchment areas are equally mapped up at this point in time. The catchments were not mapped out for restoration or rehabilitation. This will be done after demarcation.

Output 2: Improved agricultural practices and alternative livelihood options in the wetland and associated catchment areas promoted
This output has been implemented to a small extent. A number of processes were started but have not yet contributed to the indicator result. This can be attributed to the late start of implementation.</narrative>
