     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since Project inception in August 2021, preparatory activities commenced and are on going.

Output 1: Degraded wetlands, and associated catchments restored and or rehabilitated and intact wetlands protected

This output was not accomplished. 5 wetlands were identified and demarcation is ongoing. The restoration process will commence after demarcation.
Result 1.2: The process of mapping catchment areas is done. Plans are underway to restore catchments through tree planting, establishment of nurseries. Catchment management planning with communities and soil and water conservation measures will be implemented next year.

Output 2: Improved agricultural practices and alternative livelihood options in the wetland and associated catchment areas promoted.
Results achieved under output 2
Establishment of demonstration gardens and farming groups to adopt climate resilient / climate smart agricultural practices is underway. This includes installation of portable irrigation systems which will be replicated on members of the farmer groups who are being mobilized. The project will support these farmer groups through hands on training and provision of inputs and implements.</narrative>
